msgid "VAAPI needs your GPU's VA-API driver. Install it with your package manager:\n\nIntel\n• Debian/Ubuntu: intel-media-va-driver-non-free\n• Fedora (RPM Fusion), Arch: intel-media-driver\n\nAMD\n• Debian/Ubuntu: mesa-va-drivers\n• Fedora (RPM Fusion): mesa-va-drivers-freeworld\n• Arch: mesa\n\nRun vainfo to check that the driver loads. NVIDIA GPUs use the NVIDIA GPU option instead."
